WEBVTT

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.277
After having a shocking
encounter with...

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.653
...her older brother Lennon
in the Magical Realm...

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:02.058
...they were chased by the witch police
and escaped to Witch Heaven.

00:01:02.963 --> 00:01:05.489
The three members of
the special task force...

00:01:05.599 --> 00:01:08.432
...rebelled against Atelia,
who is losing her powers.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:13.871
Arusu and the others went to help her,
but the warlocks appeared.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.838
They mistook Lennon for Arusu
and took him away.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.868
Tweeny Witches

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:59.868
Dad's Alive

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:03.645
Those who can't protect
their loved ones...

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.310
How could you protect magic
if you don't...

00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:08.945
...even have the intention
of making others happy!

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:11.250
You want to protect Lennon even if...

00:03:11.358 --> 00:03:14.259
...you have to give up the fairies
and the True Book of Spells.

00:03:14.361 --> 00:03:16.557
Isn't that what a mother
is supposed to think?

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.997
But we can't just let them
do as they please!

00:03:19.099 --> 00:03:22.797
Do you understand? There's only
one important thing in your life.

00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:27.406
If you let go of Lennon now, then
you will definitely regret it, you know!

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.599
You see, Arusu...

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:34.841
Lennon... Lennon was captured
instead of you, Arusu.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:41.651
We know that you're hiding the
True Book of Spells somewhere.

00:03:41.755 --> 00:03:45.817
If you don't want us to kill your father,
then hand over the True Book of Spells!

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:46.653
Luca.

00:03:47.327 --> 00:03:50.592
Witches have occupied the palatium
and are heading this way.

00:03:50.697 --> 00:03:52.756
They're going berserk.

00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:55.360
If they keep going like this,
we will lose...

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:58.631
...many of our soldiers even
before completing our task!

00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:00.636
Those witches!

00:04:02.509 --> 00:04:05.774
Didn't you say you found
a way to get out of here?

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:09.409
Yeah, I somehow managed
to stir things up.

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:12.543
This door will open just once more.

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:14.787
That will be our last chance.

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:20.918
| can't believe my dad
is in Wizard Kingdom.

00:04:21.061 --> 00:04:23.621
I'm sorry, but I need
the True Book of Spells.

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:26.933
| know how you feel.
But your father gave it to you...

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:29.559
...50 that the warlocks
can't get it, right?

00:04:29.903 --> 00:04:31.769
| don't care about that!

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:35.364
If my dad dies,
then Yoko will be very sad!

00:04:35.475 --> 00:04:36.340
Wait!

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:39.738
What are you doing?

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:43.139
Jidan. That man does not
desire to change...

00:04:43.249 --> 00:04:45.911
...his beliefs just so that
his life can be spared.

00:04:46.019 --> 00:04:48.044
How can you keep
saying things like that?

00:04:48.154 --> 00:04:50.646
Both he and Lennon.

00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:55.052
It was a mistake made by me
when I was younger.

00:04:57.163 --> 00:05:01.122
But now I have come to my senses.
| know exactly what to do now.

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:06.939
What are you doing?

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:10.203
You shouldn't be here
after evacuating the castle.

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:15.539
You lost your powers,
so you have no control over the people!

00:05:15.749 --> 00:05:18.218
From now on, this is how we rule!

00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:21.219
In other words, this is our time now!

00:05:21.788 --> 00:05:25.622
70 fairy species have been
captured by the warlocks!

00:05:25.859 --> 00:05:29.159
If they take the other 30 fairy species
and the True Book of Spells...

00:05:29.262 --> 00:05:31.107
...dark magic will be activated!

00:05:31.131 --> 00:05:32.621
...dark magic will be activated!
We don't care.

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:34.723
We were always social outcasts.

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:37.327
Before everything is destroyed,
we just want...

00:05:37.437 --> 00:05:40.304
...to know how it feels to be on top.
That's all!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.330
Carry them out!

00:05:43.042 --> 00:05:43.873
Stop it!

00:05:45.145 --> 00:05:46.078
Stop!

00:05:48.281 --> 00:05:49.476
Damn!

00:05:52.318 --> 00:05:54.412
Leave everything to me.

00:05:54.821 --> 00:05:56.755
Please take care of the fairies.

00:05:57.123 --> 00:06:00.821
Listen to me! My fellow witches!

00:06:01.161 --> 00:06:04.153
With destruction of the realm
upon us, our enemies are...

00:06:04.264 --> 00:06:07.131
...not fellow citizens
of the Magical Realm!

00:06:07.267 --> 00:06:09.326
This human here is our enemy!

00:06:09.435 --> 00:06:14.271
Although she's a human, she has the
True Book of Spells hidden somewhere!

00:06:14.707 --> 00:06:15.731
That's right!

00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:20.177
Humans are trying to sink us
into the depths of despair!

00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:24.274
Get the True Book of Spells
from the human!

00:06:24.384 --> 00:06:27.285
As fellow citizens of
the Magical Realm...

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:30.080
...we're going to fight those humans!

00:06:30.723 --> 00:06:34.626
If you want us to spare your life, then
tell us the whereabouts of the book!

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:37.795
If you don't,
then you might end up dead...

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:41.424
...long before you can
save your father, Arusu.

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:44.934
Stop this! The person you see
before you is not Arusu!

00:06:45.171 --> 00:06:46.104
What?

00:06:47.607 --> 00:06:50.838
That means the child doesn't
have the True Book of Spells.

00:06:50.944 --> 00:06:53.845
And your hostage Jidan
happens to be my husband.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:56.244
Your husband? It can't be!

00:06:56.482 --> 00:06:58.041
He's a human!

00:06:58.151 --> 00:07:02.315
You're one of the three sages.
You can't possibly be his wife!

00:07:02.422 --> 00:07:04.584
| broke the law of the witches...

00:07:04.657 --> 00:07:07.285
...and fell in love with a male human.

00:07:07.594 --> 00:07:11.053
| was never qualified to be
a sage in the first place.

00:07:11.464 --> 00:07:14.456
| should be the one who
deserves to be punished!

00:07:14.567 --> 00:07:16.001
Do you really mean that?

00:07:16.536 --> 00:07:19.506
If you agree,
then take me instead of him.

00:07:19.873 --> 00:07:20.431
What?

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:22.701
Interesting. Capture her!

00:07:22.809 --> 00:07:23.537
Yes, sir!

00:07:26.846 --> 00:07:28.940
Tell us where Arusu is!

00:07:29.849 --> 00:07:32.750
She's my obedient apprentice witch.

00:07:32.986 --> 00:07:35.956
If you capture me,
then she will definitely come here.

00:07:36.756 --> 00:07:39.088
I'm going to Wizard Kingdom.

00:07:39.259 --> 00:07:42.820
| know that my dad doesn't want me
to hand over the True Book of Spells.

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:46.559
But his mother has to be
the one to save Lennon.

00:07:47.267 --> 00:07:51.363
But then again, I can't just
let her save my dad as well...

00:07:51.471 --> 00:07:55.533
...and just keep hiding
with the True Book of Spells.

00:07:55.942 --> 00:08:00.175
But Atelia said this was all
because of her mistake...

00:08:00.313 --> 00:08:02.247
It wasn't a mistake at all.

00:08:02.348 --> 00:08:04.874
If she didn't save my dad, and...

00:08:05.018 --> 00:08:09.182
...if the two of them hadn't met, then
| probably wouldn't be here right now.

00:08:09.289 --> 00:08:10.688
You're right.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:14.317
But what about the fairies? You're going
to hand them the True Book of Spells?

00:08:14.427 --> 00:08:16.862
| don't want to deny this moment.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:17.856
This moment?

00:08:18.131 --> 00:08:21.692
The fact that I'm here now, as well as
the fact that I met both of you.

00:08:21.801 --> 00:08:22.461
Fine.

00:08:22.568 --> 00:08:24.627
Leave this place to us. Go!

00:08:26.973 --> 00:08:30.739
You people are always
getting in our way!

00:08:42.622 --> 00:08:45.421
Why do you care about me
all of a sudden?

00:08:45.525 --> 00:08:47.289
| don't care if I get killed.

00:08:47.393 --> 00:08:50.419
I did a terrible thing to you.

00:08:51.264 --> 00:08:52.959
Run away! Hurry!

00:08:55.268 --> 00:08:56.235
Mother!

00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:05.554
Help me out, Eva!

00:09:05.578 --> 00:09:06.511
Help me out, Eva!
You bet!

00:09:08.381 --> 00:09:09.143
Huh?

00:09:09.515 --> 00:09:10.311
Hey!

00:09:11.217 --> 00:09:12.514
What should I do?

00:09:17.757 --> 00:09:18.918
Lennon!

00:09:20.493 --> 00:09:21.460
Arusu!

00:09:22.028 --> 00:09:25.965
Those who break the law of the
Magical Realm must be punished!

00:09:26.032 --> 00:09:27.898
Yeah!

00:09:31.504 --> 00:09:32.972
What is that?

00:09:35.208 --> 00:09:38.735
Now Witch Heaven is starting to decay...

00:09:38.978 --> 00:09:42.141
When is Arusu coming?
And the True Book of Spells?

00:09:42.348 --> 00:09:44.544
She is not going to come.

00:09:44.751 --> 00:09:45.479
What?

00:09:45.785 --> 00:09:48.584
I'm going to save my son,
accept all the...

00:09:48.654 --> 00:09:51.783
...hatred from the frightened citizens,
and perish.

00:09:51.924 --> 00:09:54.621
This is the path
| have chosen as a sage!

00:09:54.861 --> 00:09:56.488
You said it so easily!

00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:58.360
Wait just a minute!

00:10:01.501 --> 00:10:02.559
Why are you here?

00:10:02.635 --> 00:10:06.367
That's Arusu! She's the human
with the True Book of Spells!

00:10:06.472 --> 00:10:10.602
She's the one who's trying to
sink us into the depths of despair!

00:10:10.843 --> 00:10:12.971
Hey, I said wait!

00:10:13.212 --> 00:10:17.945
Why do you hate humans so much?
What did the humans do to you?

00:10:18.217 --> 00:10:20.709
They don't accept anything
they can't understand.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.948
They don't believe in magic.

00:10:23.423 --> 00:10:26.620
| don't know about other humans,
but I know...

00:10:26.726 --> 00:10:29.286
...that Arusu truly believes in magic.

00:10:29.362 --> 00:10:32.354
Otherwise, she wouldn't
be able to fly like this!

00:10:32.498 --> 00:10:36.594
Honestly, you warlocks are the ones
who don't believe in magic!

00:10:36.702 --> 00:10:40.536
We believe in the only magic
that can save us from destruction.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:41.937
Dark magic!

00:10:42.108 --> 00:10:45.703
That is why we need
the True Book of Spells!

00:10:45.812 --> 00:10:47.576
Don't be fooled by him!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.581
Dark magic is a magic
that destroys everything!

00:10:50.683 --> 00:10:54.085
Shut up, you traitor
who's sided with humans!

00:10:54.187 --> 00:10:55.985
Fine! I heard what you said!

00:10:56.089 --> 00:10:59.548
Then I'll make you believe
in humans again!

00:10:59.725 --> 00:11:02.023
I'm going to Wizard Kingdom.

00:11:02.128 --> 00:11:04.995
I'll hand over the True Book of Spells
to your boss, save my dad...

00:11:05.064 --> 00:11:06.408
...and come back here!

00:11:06.432 --> 00:11:07.297
...and come back here!
No, Arusu!

00:11:07.433 --> 00:11:08.210
Anything but that!

00:11:08.234 --> 00:11:09.463
Anything but that!
Don't worry.

00:11:09.569 --> 00:11:12.869
I'm not afraid of dark magic or the
destruction. We have the magic of light!

00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:13.832
Magic of...

00:11:14.006 --> 00:11:14.837
light?

00:11:15.041 --> 00:11:19.342
Anyway, I'll show you that
humans keep their promises.

00:11:19.612 --> 00:11:24.482
So until I return,
don't you punish Atelia. Got it?

00:11:33.392 --> 00:11:36.384
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.933 --> 00:11:45.393
Promise

00:11:46.706 --> 00:11:51.337
We currently have 29 different
species of fairies in our hands!

00:11:52.578 --> 00:11:55.604
What should I do?
There's nothing I can do...

00:11:56.015 --> 00:11:58.950
It's all over.
Everything, including our traditions.

00:11:59.085 --> 00:12:00.951
It's because of Atelia.

00:12:01.254 --> 00:12:03.985
She abandoned us.

00:12:05.558 --> 00:12:07.959
Atelia tried to resist
till the very end, but...

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:11.690
...because they discovered her act
of treachery, she fell from power!

00:12:11.864 --> 00:12:15.630
We're going to establish a
new government for ourselves!

00:12:15.701 --> 00:12:17.430
Yeah!

00:12:17.603 --> 00:12:21.369
| can't believe that witches like them
would trample over all hope...

00:12:21.974 --> 00:12:24.966
What should I do, Grand Master?

00:12:27.413 --> 00:12:29.074
Over there?

00:12:29.248 --> 00:12:31.910
Who's there?
What are you talking about?

00:12:32.218 --> 00:12:33.185
Sheila!

00:12:33.653 --> 00:12:34.882
It's Arusu!

00:12:35.955 --> 00:12:36.965
What should I do?

00:12:36.989 --> 00:12:38.252
What should I do?
If we don't do anything...

00:12:38.324 --> 00:12:40.656
...Grande is going to get Arusu, and...

00:12:42.628 --> 00:12:45.598
Lennon was captured in place of Arusu.

00:12:46.098 --> 00:12:49.261
Atelia was captured
in order to save Lennon.

00:12:49.669 --> 00:12:52.730
In order to save Atelia and
her father, Arusu is now...

00:12:52.838 --> 00:12:54.932
...heading towards Wizard Kingdom.

00:12:55.107 --> 00:12:58.407
She even agreed to hand over
the True Book of Spells...

00:12:58.844 --> 00:13:02.906
They try to take advantage of us
every time we try to save someone.

00:13:03.082 --> 00:13:04.982
We lose things little by little...

00:13:05.084 --> 00:13:08.054
And by the time we realize it,
dark magic will be...

00:13:08.187 --> 00:13:11.680
If we keep going like this,
we can never win...

00:13:13.092 --> 00:13:14.150
Sheila?

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:17.193
Anyway, let's just head over
to Wizard Kingdom.

00:13:17.296 --> 00:13:18.695
Wait, Sheila!

00:13:19.332 --> 00:13:22.666
What should I do?
| can't use my magic anymore.

00:13:22.768 --> 00:13:23.428
What?

00:13:23.536 --> 00:13:28.098
Just as I thought, the magic is gone!
I might die!

00:13:28.574 --> 00:13:29.905
It can't be.

00:13:31.077 --> 00:13:33.102
What should we do?

00:13:34.447 --> 00:13:35.937
What are you going to do?

00:13:36.582 --> 00:13:40.109
Are you really going to hand the
True Book of Spells to the warlocks?

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.631
Do you know "Run, Melos"?

00:13:42.655 --> 00:13:43.213
Do you know "Run, Melos"?
What?

00:13:43.356 --> 00:13:46.553
| always wanted to
do it like "Run, Melos."

00:13:46.792 --> 00:13:48.170
You were winging it.

00:13:48.194 --> 00:13:49.787
You were winging it.
So were you, Lennon.

00:13:49.895 --> 00:13:52.830
You were winging things
when you said you were me.

00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:56.829
I did it because I thought
it was about me too.

00:13:56.936 --> 00:14:00.566
After I heard that your dad
was in this realm and being...

00:14:00.673 --> 00:14:03.040
...held captive by the warlocks.

00:14:03.542 --> 00:14:07.274
You're right. We're supposed
to be mirrors of each other.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:11.014
Your dad is also my dad as well.

00:14:11.217 --> 00:14:14.676
We have to save them.
Both Dad and Mama Atelia.

00:14:14.854 --> 00:14:15.480
Yeah.

00:14:16.289 --> 00:14:18.485
I'll show them a thing or two!

00:14:19.025 --> 00:14:21.050
You're strong, Arusu.

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:33.537
It's much different than
the last time we came.

00:14:33.606 --> 00:14:34.095
Yeah.

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:37.810
| guess everything is
going to be destroyed.

00:14:39.011 --> 00:14:40.706
Didn't I tell you, Eva?

00:14:40.813 --> 00:14:43.510
You're going through a slump.
If you practice...

00:14:43.616 --> 00:14:46.916
| was able to use lots of magic,
but now it's over!

00:14:48.387 --> 00:14:50.321
| can't let that happen.

00:14:50.456 --> 00:14:51.116
Damn it!

00:14:52.024 --> 00:14:55.289
I shouldn't rush things!
We can only do so little.

00:14:55.461 --> 00:14:58.453
We need to think about
our objective more carefully.

00:14:59.432 --> 00:15:01.628
Arusu is going to Wizard Kingdom?

00:15:01.901 --> 00:15:02.629
Yeah.

00:15:02.968 --> 00:15:05.835
I told Grande that she has
the True Book of Spells, and...

00:15:05.938 --> 00:15:07.633
...that you're her father.

00:15:08.074 --> 00:15:10.566
If Arusu knows that you're
being held captive here...

00:15:10.676 --> 00:15:14.306
...then she will definitely come here
with the True Book of Spells.

00:15:14.513 --> 00:15:18.472
Is that your plan for
getting out of here?

00:15:19.018 --> 00:15:21.282
You used my daughter to get out...

00:15:21.387 --> 00:15:22.786
That's not true!

00:15:24.657 --> 00:15:27.786
| once had a father who
stood up against Grande.

00:15:28.594 --> 00:15:30.255
He was a prophet.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.832
When my father learned that
this realm would be destroyed...

00:15:34.934 --> 00:15:37.904
...he advised Grande
not to use dark magic.

00:15:38.437 --> 00:15:41.896
He told Grande that a savior
would appear to save this realm.

00:15:42.041 --> 00:15:45.739
So he told him not to use
dark magic by any means.

00:15:46.645 --> 00:15:48.670
But Grande...

00:15:52.017 --> 00:15:54.349
| obey Grande's orders.

00:15:55.054 --> 00:15:59.184
| pretended to obey his orders
and searched for this savior.

00:16:00.326 --> 00:16:01.987
Then I saw her.

00:16:02.862 --> 00:16:04.626
| met Arusu.

00:16:05.931 --> 00:16:09.595
| needed to use any means
necessary to bring Arusu here...

00:16:09.702 --> 00:16:12.728
...and to tell her about everything.

00:16:13.939 --> 00:16:15.930
This is for my father as well.

00:16:16.509 --> 00:16:19.501
This realm can't be saved by dark magic.

00:16:19.612 --> 00:16:21.706
Only Arusu can save this place!

00:16:21.847 --> 00:16:23.281
My daughter?

00:16:23.582 --> 00:16:26.210
She's the savior of this realm?

00:16:28.754 --> 00:16:30.449
We're almost there!

00:16:30.556 --> 00:16:32.820
You're a guy, right? Hang in there!

00:16:32.925 --> 00:16:35.417
Weren't you going to save us?

00:16:42.435 --> 00:16:45.268
Quietly hand over the
True Book of Spells!

00:16:45.638 --> 00:16:48.972
Wait a minute!
The book for the hostage! You promised!

00:16:49.074 --> 00:16:51.270
We never meant to keep that promise!

00:16:51.377 --> 00:16:52.674
You people...

00:16:52.812 --> 00:16:56.874
Hey, you! You're a disgrace
to the warlocks!

00:17:00.719 --> 00:17:03.620
I'll let you go for today. Disappear!

00:17:05.591 --> 00:17:07.457
You were all right, Wil?

00:17:08.294 --> 00:17:10.661
Even if I wanted to die, it seems...

00:17:10.763 --> 00:17:13.596
...the good lord above just won't let me.

00:17:14.733 --> 00:17:16.997
So this is the kid from that time?

00:17:17.102 --> 00:17:18.866
Yeah, his name is Lennon.

00:17:18.971 --> 00:17:21.269
I did a terrible thing to you.

00:17:21.407 --> 00:17:22.033
What?

00:17:22.241 --> 00:17:25.575
Well, I guess to your mother, that is.

00:17:26.612 --> 00:17:28.910
Where's Lennon? Where's Jidan?

00:17:29.515 --> 00:17:31.779
| came since I heard they were here.

00:17:31.884 --> 00:17:34.785
| don't know. Maybe it was some mistake.

00:17:35.287 --> 00:17:37.381
But hey, you have to...

00:17:37.523 --> 00:17:41.289
...bring back the True Book of Spells
to Witch Heaven, right?

00:17:41.961 --> 00:17:44.521
You can't stay here because
you can't get over them...

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:46.928
| don't care about the Witch Realm.

00:17:47.032 --> 00:17:52.527
| just want to be with Lennon and
Jidan forever. That's what I realized!

00:17:52.638 --> 00:17:55.164
| already told you. He's not here!

00:17:58.811 --> 00:18:01.143
This is what you wanted, right?

00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:07.049
Even to this day, I don't know
if I did the right thing back then...

00:18:09.722 --> 00:18:11.884
I didn't know my mother did that...

00:18:12.725 --> 00:18:14.659
I'm sorry about that.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:18.487
I'm the one who should be
apologizing. To my mother, that is...

00:18:18.697 --> 00:18:22.190
Then we have to save your mother.

00:18:29.208 --> 00:18:31.870
You brought the
True Book of Spells, right?

00:18:31.977 --> 00:18:33.455
My dad better be here!

00:18:33.479 --> 00:18:34.446
My dad better be here!
This way!

00:18:46.458 --> 00:18:48.449
Now, where's my dad?

00:18:48.561 --> 00:18:49.926
So you're the one?

00:18:50.029 --> 00:18:53.158
The one who has the True Book of Spells?

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.859
That's Grande's voice.

00:18:57.036 --> 00:19:00.336
Are you listening?
| asked you where my dad is!

00:19:00.573 --> 00:19:05.101
Then place the True Book of Spells
there and step back.

00:19:05.244 --> 00:19:07.235
| mean, who do you think you are?

00:19:07.346 --> 00:19:09.610
Show yourself! It's very rude!

00:19:09.915 --> 00:19:11.246
That bastard Grande.

00:19:11.383 --> 00:19:14.114
Are you listening?
I don't have much time!

00:19:14.219 --> 00:19:18.588
| need to get this done fast
and return to where everyone is!

00:19:18.824 --> 00:19:20.952
Just let me see my dad!

00:19:21.193 --> 00:19:22.820
What are you doing?

00:19:23.095 --> 00:19:26.759
That man...
Your father is not here, Arusu!

00:19:27.466 --> 00:19:29.594
No way! Why? Since when?

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.568
Then our deal is off.

00:19:37.743 --> 00:19:40.838
Arusu, there's no need
to give them the book.

00:19:40.913 --> 00:19:43.041
We'll just get really rowdy and...

00:19:43.148 --> 00:19:43.910
Wait!

00:19:44.249 --> 00:19:46.479
They still have Atelia.

00:19:46.585 --> 00:19:47.245
What?

00:19:47.386 --> 00:19:49.718
Even if my dad is alive somewhere...

00:19:49.822 --> 00:19:53.520
...Atelia will die if I don't hand them
the True Book of Spells.

00:19:54.293 --> 00:19:55.488
Don't do it, Arusu!

00:19:55.594 --> 00:19:58.962
Our objective is not to
save someone else's life!

00:20:01.367 --> 00:20:03.995
Let me have the True Book of Spells!

00:20:04.637 --> 00:20:05.468
Arusu!

00:20:05.838 --> 00:20:09.706
Our objective is to prevent
the use of dark magic!

00:20:17.783 --> 00:20:25.747
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.924 --> 00:20:33.924
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:35.167 --> 00:20:43.167
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:44.376 --> 00:20:49.940
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:50.049 --> 00:20:54.316
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:55.054 --> 00:20:59.287
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:59.391 --> 00:21:03.988
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:04.196 --> 00:21:09.362
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:09.468 --> 00:21:12.529
Let's hope it does.

00:21:14.106 --> 00:21:18.600
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.711 --> 00:21:21.203
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:21.313 --> 00:21:29.313
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:30.522 --> 00:21:36.222
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:36.328 --> 00:21:40.526
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
